00:13:02.850 --> 00:13:04.320
Don't say that, Inuzuka-kun.

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:07.020
Sensei doesn't want people to know about that.

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:08.950
Inuzuka, you bastard...

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:10.600
Inuzuka, you bastard.

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:12.430
Inuzuka, you bastard!

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:15.300
Just because you are popular among girls...

00:13:15.710 --> 00:13:17.930
I... Inuzuka! Step forward!

00:13:18.160 --> 00:13:19.310
What is it?

00:13:19.490 --> 00:13:22.470
If it's corporal punishment, then according to the regional public servant law, article 29,

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:24.710
in the case of a violation of...

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:26.160
Nonsense! Speak Japanese!

00:13:26.340 --> 00:13:27.650
More importantly, stop reading the book!

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:30.400
Inuzuka, do a 50 meters sprint.

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:34.640
