00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:35.850
Sure, sure.

00:13:39.610 --> 00:13:40.730
7.3 seconds.

00:13:41.990 --> 00:13:43.320
A commoner's ability.

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:43.800
He's so wonderful!

00:13:43.940 --> 00:13:45.680
Koushi-dono, you are wonderful.

00:13:45.730 --> 00:13:46.690
Oh, right...

00:13:46.190 --> 00:13:47.790
Inuzuka-kun, you are so cool!

00:13:48.710 --> 00:13:50.880
Girls, don't be fooled!

00:13:51.020 --> 00:13:53.750
The face doesn't make a man, the strength does!

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:56.480
