00:13:58.030 --> 00:14:00.420
50 meters sprinting makes a sports man!

00:14:00.720 --> 00:14:02.920
What do you think of my powerful running style?

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:04.630
The fundamental of sports is about speed!

00:14:04.960 --> 00:14:06.450
I can see it, I can see it!

00:14:06.510 --> 00:14:08.160
The light from the finishing line!

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:11.920
Koushi-dono~!

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:14.440
