00:14:30.480 --> 00:14:31.950
Momoko-chan, you are amazing!

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:34.700
You are way better than sensei!

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:37.800
Curse Inuzuka and that cousin of his...

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:40.680
