00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:45.560
Side stepping makes a sports man!

00:14:45.880 --> 00:14:49.600
The fundamental of sports is not about speed, it's about reflex!

00:14:49.940 --> 00:14:52.300
What do you think of that, Inuzuka's cousin?

00:14:52.510 --> 00:14:53.770
