00:14:57.480 --> 00:14:59.340
She's moving at an incredible speed!

00:14:59.570 --> 00:15:00.690
It's an illusion!

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:02.430
Amazing reflex!

00:15:02.570 --> 00:15:04.700
You are way better than sensei, Momoko-chan!

00:15:04.860 --> 00:15:06.370
