00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:55.750
But a promise is a promise.

00:16:56.010 --> 00:16:57.590
You are not going to pass this course!

00:16:57.840 --> 00:17:02.100
Article 193 of the criminal law, malpractice.

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:04.670
If a public servant breaches his duty...

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:05.720
Shut up, shut up!

00:17:05.910 --> 00:17:07.970
