00:17:16.240 --> 00:17:20.300
However, if you keep on failing phys-ed, you can't graduate.

00:17:20.520 --> 00:17:25.610
Then you can't enter university, you can't take the law exam, and of course you can't become a prosecutor.

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:32.470
Your dream and effort will be flushed down the toilet right here!

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:37.810
Feel my vengeance!

00:17:38.060 --> 00:17:39.660
I won't let that happen!

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:43.120
I will jump!

00:17:43.530 --> 00:17:44.770
I'll show you I can jump!

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:56.460
Koushi-dono...

00:17:56.830 --> 00:17:58.660
